AB  - Emirates Airlines' sustainable initiatives in their worldwide marketing strategy, market dynamics of entry, and customer environmental concerns are examined in this study. This study will use a qualitative exploratory research design to combine Emirates Group employee views with a detailed analysis of corporate data. The statistics demonstrate Emirates Airlines' sustainability strategy, which has made them market leaders. Customers also notice this commitment to sustainability and choose that airline for it. Emirates Airlines can dominate the international aviation business by focusing on sustainability, which is less harmful to nature. Strong green marketing strategies change brand loyalty, according to data. The prior sentence emphasizes air transport environmental protection. Synthesizing eco-friendly aircraft fuels and choosing foreign technological advantages are also covered in the dissertation. The study found that sustainable airplane environmental performance improves economic performance and public participation.
